{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_03243d4a4a8589c88a69b0266e1a9fb1d75106a6e6143e991dfad6a5b013d91e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Activation works by dynamically symlinking Skills, Agents, and Commands into subdirectories (skills/, agents/, commands/) of each assistant's project or global config directory."},{"claim_ids":["clm_05ead86cc9099c73b7454b891c51f24213613ef455f421f28e347b70e53432c1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Besides directory linking, native plugin configurations are provided for Claude Code (.claude-plugin/), Codex (.codex-plugin/), and Cursor (.cursor-plugin/)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2a24b0d54acef71baa62a0642f967e44a946db75a1e9d62fbde2eb5c81c6a629"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Skills can alternatively be installed via Vercel's `skills` CLI (npx skills@latest add guanyang/open-agent-hub) without cloning the repository."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4d7f59ce6db9a2a0085ede3639ae87b2597fed536e2c41ff078eaa4fb43a1e6d"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: GEMINI.md provides project-level LLM coding behavioral guidelines (think before coding, simplicity first, surgical changes, goal-driven execution) derived from andrej-karpathy-skills, and CONTRIBUTING.md covers contribution guidelines."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7b4d2adfb07d2156621f177dccfe6d17a5b52ddf3dd77a9e936efed4df5441c6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Components use standardized Markdown prompts with YAML frontmatter metadata, which host agents parse to decide when to trigger and load skills."},{"claim_ids":["clm_95df2b689817c869eef4a8e3a7b09da3077b3e886284d83ede2c9ed549791f9c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool is described as a lightweight, zero-dependency CLI for managing and activating AI coding assistant capabilities."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a1f72dca6c30518bf8dc05977680759a2e33d68ee3f195d9b44b81808c6a6687"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The --target option supports claude, antigravity, gemini, codex, cursor, trae, opencode, kiro, and all, defaulting to claude."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d84a5fc1d2e34b5563dd03f8bc0b7f9916b30fd4fdcc14f2567ea130005c8117"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The `oah` CLI provides list, status, enable, disable, and sync commands, with filters (--skills/--agents/--commands), --global, --target, and --path options."}],"claim_ids":["clm_03243d4a4a8589c88a69b0266e1a9fb1d75106a6e6143e991dfad6a5b013d91e","clm_05ead86cc9099c73b7454b891c51f24213613ef455f421f28e347b70e53432c1","clm_2a24b0d54acef71baa62a0642f967e44a946db75a1e9d62fbde2eb5c81c6a629","clm_4d7f59ce6db9a2a0085ede3639ae87b2597fed536e2c41ff078eaa4fb43a1e6d","clm_7b4d2adfb07d2156621f177dccfe6d17a5b52ddf3dd77a9e936efed4df5441c6","clm_95df2b689817c869eef4a8e3a7b09da3077b3e886284d83ede2c9ed549791f9c","clm_a1f72dca6c30518bf8dc05977680759a2e33d68ee3f195d9b44b81808c6a6687","clm_d84a5fc1d2e34b5563dd03f8bc0b7f9916b30fd4fdcc14f2567ea130005c8117"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_56aeaa09f65f48c0aa2da5557e97c75b","id":"pg_15de4f2269195134ab9d51ce1c5e82be","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/guanyang-open-agent-hub-readme-md-c90c4f2b25ba-51ce1c5e82be.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_030de828c05c55128ca80ea7478b1e40"],"title":"guanyang/open-agent-hub/README.md @ c90c4f2b25ba","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:56:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_56aeaa09f65f48c0aa2da5557e97c75b"}
